  "description": "Split conformal prediction for .NET at MAPIE parity: turn a point prediction into an interval, or a class into a prediction set, with a finite-sample coverage guarantee. Post-hoc over scores and labels — no model, no training loop, no dependencies. The guarantee assumes exchangeable calibration and test data; it does not hold for time series.",
